{
  "_comment": [
    "The template's development catalogue. Multi-vertical on purpose, per",
    "Salil's amendment to handoff 5.0: the reference build is a tyre",
    "distributor whose five categories are tyre shaped, and building against",
    "that bakes in assumptions that hold for one vertical only.",
    "",
    "category_path is hierarchical, 'Fashion > Footwear', because the Dengage",
    "contract is hierarchical and adding depth later touches the nav, the grid,",
    "the filters and every pageView.",
    "",
    "Attributes vary by product on purpose. A jacket has sizes, a laptop has",
    "specs, and the card renders what exists rather than assuming a fixed set.",
    "",
    "stockCount is absent on some products rather than zero. Absent means the",
    "scrape did not produce one; zero would announce the product out of stock",
    "and poison every back-in-stock segment. Handoff 1.8.",
    "",
    "Every product has a price, because unit_price and discounted_price are",
    "REQUIRED parameters on ec:addToCart. The generator drops a product whose",
    "price it could not scrape rather than inventing one. Handoff 15a."
  ],

